---
title: "Zanzibar Hotels & Beach Resorts | Partner Directory & Transfers"
description: "Discover curated Zanzibar partner hotels and resorts across Nungwi, Kendwa, Stone Town, Paje, and Matemwe. Private door-to-door airport transfers ($55), VIP concierge rates, and excursion pickups."
permalink: "/hotels/index.html"
---
{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="content">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>Where to Stay in Zanzibar — Partner Hotels & Resorts</h1>
    <p class="page-meta">{{ stats.total_hotels }} curated properties across Unguja & Pemba. Private airport transfers ($55 to Nungwi/Kendwa), daily excursion pickups, and VIP concierge rates.</p>
  </header>

  <!-- High-Intent Commercial Booking Callout Banner -->
  <section class="hotel-vip-banner" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(20, 50, 70, 0.95), rgba(15, 30, 45, 0.98)), url('{{ 'beach-front-hotel-palm-trees-people.jpg' | cdnFile }}') center/cover; color: #fff; padding: 2.2rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);">
    <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
      <span style="display: inline-block; background: #C59A45; color: #111; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem; border-radius: 50px; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Door-to-Door Zanzibar Travel Service</span>
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.85rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; color: #fff; font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;">Staying at One of These Hotels? We Handle Your Logistics.</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; max-width: 760px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
        Whether you have already reserved your room or need expert local recommendations, Spice and Sail provides door-to-door private transfers, hotel reception meet-and-greets, and lobby departures for all top-rated ocean excursions and mainland wildlife safaris.
      </p>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="/transfers/airport-to-nungwi/" class="btn btn-primary" style="background: #C59A45; border-color: #C59A45; color: #111; font-weight: 700;">🚖 Airport Transfers ($55 Fixed)</a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/255672450934?text=Hi%20Spice%20and%20Sail%2C%20I%20am%20planning%20my%20Zanzibar%20trip%20and%20would%20like%20hotel%20and%20tour%20package%20recommendations." target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary" style="background: #25D366; border-color: #25D366; color: #fff; font-weight: 700;">💬 Chat with Local Concierge</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="filters-bar">
    <button class="filter-btn active" data-filter="all">All Tiers</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="luxury">Luxury (5-Star)</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="upper-mid">Upper Mid-Range (4-Star)</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="mid">Mid-Range (3-Star)</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="standard">Guest Houses & Budget</button>
  </div>

  <section class="cards-grid hotel-grid">
    {% for hotel in hotels %}
      <article class="card hotel-card reveal" data-tier="{{ hotel.tier }}" data-zone="{{ hotel.zone }}" data-island="{{ hotel.island }}">
        <div class="card-image" style="position: relative; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 16/10;">
          {% set hImg = hotel.name | hotelImg %}
          <img src="{{ hImg | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ hImg | canonicalAlt(hotel.name) }}" loading="lazy" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;">
          <span class="card-badge badge-{{ hotel.tier | lower | replace('upper-', '') }}" style="position: absolute; top: 12px; left: 12px; z-index: 2;">{{ hotel.tier | capitalize }}</span>
          {% if hotel.zone %}
            <span class="card-zone-badge" style="position: absolute; bottom: 12px; left: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.65); color: #fff; font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; backdrop-filter: blur(4px);">📍 {{ hotel.zone }}</span>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="card-content" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; flex-grow: 1; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <div>
            <h3 class="card-title" style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; font-size: 1.15rem;">
              {{ hotel.name }}
            </h3>
            <p class="card-meta" style="color: #666; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 0.6rem;">
              {{ hotel.zone }}{% if hotel.zone %}, {% endif %}{{ hotel.island }}{% if hotel.star_rating %} • <strong>{{ hotel.star_rating }}</strong>{% endif %}
            </p>
            {% if hotel.category %}<p class="card-description" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.4; color: #444; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">{{ hotel.category }}</p>{% endif %}
            
            <div class="card-perk" style="background: rgba(197, 154, 69, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #C59A45; padding: 0.5rem 0.65rem; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; font-size: 0.82rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #444;">
              ✨ <strong>Hotel Lobby Pickup:</strong> Available for Mnemba, Safari Blue, and Stone Town tours.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card-actions" style="margin-top: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem;">
            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.5rem;">
              {% if hotel.zone == "Nungwi" or hotel.zone == "Kendwa" %}
                <a href="/transfers/airport-to-nungwi/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" style="text-align: center; font-size: 0.8rem; padding: 0.5rem 0.3rem;" title="Private Minivan Transfer to {{ hotel.name }}">🚖 Transfer ($55)</a>
              {% else %}
                <a href="https://wa.me/255672450934?text=Hi%20Spice%20and%20Sail%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20book%20a%20private%20airport%20transfer%20to%20{{ hotel.name | urlencode }}%20in%20{{ hotel.zone | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" style="text-align: center; font-size: 0.8rem; padding: 0.5rem 0.3rem;" title="Book Airport Transfer to {{ hotel.name }}">🚖 Book Transfer</a>
              {% endif %}
              <a href="https://wa.me/255672450934?text=Hi%20Spice%20and%20Sail%2C%20please%20quote%20VIP%20partner%20rates%20and%20tour%20packages%20for%20{{ hotel.name | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" style="text-align: center; font-size: 0.8rem; padding: 0.5rem 0.3rem; background: #25D366; border-color: #25D366; color: #fff;" title="Inquire Partner Rates for {{ hotel.name }}">💬 VIP Rates</a>
            </div>

            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 0.35rem; padding-top: 0.5rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); font-size: 0.78rem;">
              <span class="card-price" style="font-weight: 600; color: #2C3E50;">{{ hotel.price_range or 'Seasonal Rates' }}</span>
              <a href="{{ hotel.website }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow" style="color: #888; text-decoration: underline;" title="Visit official property website">Official Site ↗</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    {% else %}
      <p class="reveal">No properties found. Adjust your filters.</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Travel Styles</span>
        <h2>Best Beaches for Your Travel Style</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Each zone has a distinct personality. Match your vibe to the right beach.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="area-quick-picks">
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
            <img src="{{ 'nungwi-beach-aerial-resort-turquoise-water.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'nungwi-beach-aerial-resort-turquoise-water.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3>Nungwi & Kendwa — Nightlife & Watersports</h3>
            <p>Full-moon parties, kite surfing, scuba diving, sunset dhow cruises. Best for couples and groups who want action.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
            <img src="{{ 'zanzibar-beach-women-walking-white-sand.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'zanzibar-beach-women-walking-white-sand.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3>Paje & Jambiani — Kitesurfing & Adventure</h3>
            <p>World-class kitesurfing lagoon, Kuza Cave excursions, seaweed farm visits. Laid-back vibe with easy activity access.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
            <img src="{{ 'stone-town-ornate-carved-door-calligraphy.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'stone-town-ornate-carved-door-calligraphy.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3>Stone Town — Culture & History</h3>
            <p>Boutique hotels in UNESCO-listed buildings. Walk to markets, museums, and the seafront. Best for culture lovers.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
            <img src="{{ 'zanzibar-rock-house-with-tourists.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'zanzibar-rock-house-with-tourists.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3>Bwejuu & Michamvi — Luxury & Seclusion</h3>
            <p>Boutique resorts, private beaches, The Rock Restaurant nearby. Best for honeymooners and those seeking tranquility.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <p class="hotel-disclaimer reveal">* We partner with select properties for referral bookings. Contact us on WhatsApp for current availability and negotiated rates.</p>
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
